<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RMP Properties half year earnings rise.</title>
<headline>RMP Properties half year earnings rise.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)   60.9	  vs 47.4</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 50.0	  vs 45.0</p>
<p>    Attrib		    25.39	 vs 17.79</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   38.22	 vs 22.53</p>
<p>    Tax			 6.21	  vs 3.03</p>
<p>    Exceptional gains     20.44	 vs 10.48</p>
<p>    Turnover		  147.65	vs 131.89</p>
<p>Div payable June 18</p>
<p>on register May 30</p>
<p>Full name: RMP Properties Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
